<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是变量吗</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>分层是真的 —— 但这个数字不能当基准</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 40}}><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 104, fontWeight: 700, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -2}}>76%</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 12}}>第三方 8-harness 对照实测 · 同一批模型</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 26}}>换成没见过的仓库，只剩 53%</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>基准的门槛比看上去高——连榜单分数本身都可能掺着记忆。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 682, flexDirection: "column", gap: 14, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>它证的是「现象」</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>分层真实存在</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D"}}>它证不了「数字」</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>快讯 + 标题级捕获，没有方法论、不可复现</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 16, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>判据：可复现、有方法论，才能当基准；否则只能当信号。</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#8A5A00", lineHeight: 1.6, padding: 16, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}>⚠️ 趋势级 —— 这条快讯对本场有利，正因如此更要当面打折。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>21 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
